&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Icon 1, WA15 0AF&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Beauty&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know that beauty isn’t one-size-fits-all. Our portfolio of leading retailers and iconic beauty brands caters to everyone, everywhere, empowering customers all over the world to look and feel fantastic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining our portfolio of owned brands inclusive of ESPA, Ameliorate and Christophe Robin,&amp;nbsp;with a marketplace for over 1,300 third-party beauty brands through online retail sites LOOKFANTASTIC, Cult Beauty, and Dermstore, THG Beauty's ambition is to be the global digital partner of choice across the beauty industry, supporting the channel shift to online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THG Beauty’s breadth of relationships is unique to the beauty market; it engages with brands as a retailer, a brand owner, and a product developer and manufacturer, making it the industry’s digital strategic leader.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Why be a Senior BI Analyst at THG Beauty?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW114187682 BCX0" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114187682 BCX0"&gt;As Senior BI Analyst for Beauty, you will own the reporting layer that enables the Beauty Data &amp;amp; Insight team and senior Beauty leadership to understand and act on business performance. You will build and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114187682 BCX0"&gt;maintain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114187682 BCX0"&gt; trusted dashboards and reports — covering customer, commercial and operational performance — ensuring that the metrics leadership relies on are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114187682 BCX0"&gt;accurate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114187682 BCX0"&gt;, consistent and drive decisions. You will work closely with the Beauty &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW114187682 BCX0"&gt;analytics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114187682 BCX0"&gt; team, the Reporting &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW114187682 BCX0"&gt;Lead&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114187682 BCX0"&gt; and the Engineering team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW103831888 BCX0" data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW103831888 BCX0"&gt;What You'll Do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Dashboard Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Own and maintain the Beauty reporting suite — dashboards covering customer performance, trading, commercial analytics and operational KPIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Build new reports and dashboards to support evolving business requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Ensure all Beauty reporting meets the metric standards set by the Reporting Lead — consistent definitions, clear labelling, reliable data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Work with the Reporting Lead to rationalise and improve the reporting estate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Write and maintain SQL queries to support reporting and ad hoc analytical requests&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Validate data — working with engineering teams to identify and resolve discrepancies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Support the Beauty analytics team with data and reporting needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Work with Beauty stakeholders — including the Head of Beauty and analytics leads — to understand reporting requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Communicate clearly about what the data shows, what it doesn't show, and why&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Manage requests effectively — setting expectations and delivering reliably&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW46979586 BCX0" data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW46979586 BCX0"&gt;THG Career Framework — What Good Looks Like at This Level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP Selected SCXW46979586 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:1579546,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Deep expertise in BI and reporting — the go-to person for Beauty reporting and metric questions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Interprets and explains data concepts clearly to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Coaches junior analysts on BI best practice and data quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Accountable for own targets — delivers to a high standard with minimal supervision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Understands how reporting quality links to business decision-making quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Makes pragmatic decisions on reporting priorities — balancing stakeholder requests with data quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW135676603 BCX0" data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW135676603 BCX0"&gt;What We're Looking For:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Essential&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Experience (typically 3+ years) in BI, reporting or analytics roles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Hands-on experience with Tableau or equivalent BI tooling — able to build production-quality dashboards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Strong SQL skills — comfortable building complex queries and validating data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Experience in e-commerce, retail or consumer goods reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Attention to detail — committed to the accuracy and consistency of what you produce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Desirable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Experience with GCP and BigQuery or equivalent cloud data platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Exposure to beauty, wellness or lifestyle brand data environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Familiarity with data governance concepts as applied to reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Experience in customer, commercial or operational analytics domains&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;What’s in it for me?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
